{
  "name": "Workflow 3 — Inventory Low Stock Alert",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "cron-003",
      "name": "Schedule — Every Hour",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [240, 300],
      "notes": "Runs every hour automatically. You can also set this to every 15 minutes, daily at 8am, etc. The Schedule Trigger replaces the old Cron node in newer n8n versions."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID_HERE",
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "value": "Inventory",
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {
          "headerRow": 1,
          "returnAllMatches": true
        }
      },
      "id": "gsheet-003-read",
      "name": "Read Inventory Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [480, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "cred-gsheets",
          "name": "Google Sheets OAuth2"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Reads all rows from the Inventory sheet. Each row becomes a separate item in n8n. Sheet columns: productName, sku, currentStock, reorderThreshold, supplier, category. See sample-data/inventory-sheet.csv"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-stock",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.currentStock }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $json.reorderThreshold }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "lte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-003",
      "name": "Filter — Below Threshold?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [720, 300],
      "notes": "The IF node splits flow: TRUE output = low stock items, FALSE output = items that are fine. We only care about TRUE. The IF node processes EACH item individually — n8n automatically loops through all rows."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "aggregate": "aggregateAllItemFields",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "agg-003",
      "name": "Aggregate — Collect All Low Stock Items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [960, 180],
      "notes": "The Aggregate node collects all individual low-stock items into a single array. This is crucial — without it, you'd send one email per item instead of one summary email. This is a very common pattern."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-empty",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.productName.length }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-003b",
      "name": "Check — Any Low Stock?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1200, 180],
      "notes": "Only send alerts if there are actually low-stock items. This prevents empty alert emails being sent every hour when everything is fine."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "inventory@yourstore.com",
        "toEmail": "ops-team@yourstore.com",
        "subject": "LOW STOCK ALERT — {{ $json.productName.length }} Product(s) Need Reordering ({{ $now.format('MMM DD, YYYY HH:mm') }})",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head><meta charset='UTF-8'></head>\n<body style='font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;'>\n  <div style='background: #DC2626; padding: 20px 30px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;'>\n    <h1 style='color: white; margin: 0; font-size: 22px;'>LOW STOCK ALERT</h1>\n    <p style='color: #FEE2E2; margin: 5px 0 0;'>{{ $json.productName.length }} product(s) require immediate reordering</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style='background: #FFF; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-top: none; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;'>\n    <p>The following products have fallen below their reorder threshold as of <strong>{{ $now.format('MMMM DD, YYYY [at] HH:mm') }}</strong>:</p>\n    <table style='width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0;'>\n      <thead>\n        <tr style='background: #F9FAFB;'>\n          <th style='padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;'>Product</th>\n          <th style='padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;'>SKU</th>\n          <th style='padding: 12px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;'>Current Stock</th>\n          <th style='padding: 12px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;'>Threshold</th>\n          <th style='padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;'>Supplier</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        {{ $json.productName.map((name, i) => `\n        <tr style=\"background: ${i % 2 === 0 ? '#FFF' : '#FFF8F8'}\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; font-weight: bold;\">${name}</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; font-family: monospace;\">${$json.sku[i]}</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; text-align: center; color: #DC2626; font-weight: bold;\">${$json.currentStock[i]}</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; text-align: center;\">${$json.reorderThreshold[i]}</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;\">${$json.supplier[i]}</td>\n        </tr>`).join('') }}\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <div style='background: #FEF2F2; padding: 15px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 4px solid #DC2626;'>\n      <p style='margin: 0; color: #991B1B;'><strong>Action Required:</strong> Please initiate purchase orders with the respective suppliers immediately to avoid stockouts.</p>\n    </div>\n    <p style='color: #6B7280; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 20px;'>This alert is generated automatically every hour by the Inventory Monitoring workflow.</p>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "email-003",
      "name": "Send Low Stock Email Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1440, 120],
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "cred-smtp",
          "name": "SMTP Account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "The aggregated data comes in as arrays (productName[], sku[], currentStock[]) — we use .map() in the template to build the HTML table rows dynamically. This is advanced but powerful."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "webhookUri": "YOUR_DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL_HERE",
        "text": "",
        "options": {
          "embeds": {
            "embed": [
              {
                "title": "INVENTORY ALERT — {{ $json.productName.length }} Low Stock Item(s)",
                "description": "The following products are below reorder threshold and need restocking:",
                "color": 16711680,
                "fields": {
                  "field": "={{ $json.productName.map((name, i) => ({ name: name, value: `Stock: **${$json.currentStock[i]}** / Threshold: ${$json.reorderThreshold[i]} | SKU: ${$json.sku[i]}`, short: false })) }}"
                },
                "footer": {
                  "text": "Check your email for the full report with supplier details"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "discord-003",
      "name": "Send Slack/Discord Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.discord",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1440, 240],
      "notes": "Discord summary provides instant visibility. The detailed email has the full table with supplier info for action."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID_HERE",
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "value": "Alert Log",
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "alertTime": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
            "itemsAffected": "={{ $json.productName.length }}",
            "productNames": "={{ $json.productName.join(', ') }}",
            "alertType": "Low Stock"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "gsheet-003-log",
      "name": "Log Alert to Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1440, 360],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "cred-gsheets",
          "name": "Google Sheets OAuth2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "err-003",
      "name": "Error Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 540]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "webhookUri": "YOUR_DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL_HERE",
        "text": "WORKFLOW ERROR in Inventory Alert!\nError: {{ $json.error.message }}\nTime: {{ $now.toISO() }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "err-notify-003",
      "name": "Alert Team on Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.discord",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [480, 540]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Schedule — Every Hour": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read Inventory Sheet",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read Inventory Sheet": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Filter — Below Threshold?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Filter — Below Threshold?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Aggregate — Collect All Low Stock Items",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    },
    "Aggregate — Collect All Low Stock Items": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check — Any Low Stock?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check — Any Low Stock?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Low Stock Email Alert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Send Slack/Discord Summary",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Log Alert to Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    },
    "Error Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Alert Team on Error",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "tags": ["ecommerce", "inventory", "alerts", "scheduled"],
  "_buildNotes": {
    "businessPurpose": "Runs silently every hour, automatically scanning your inventory sheet and sending instant email + Discord alerts the moment any product drops below its reorder threshold — eliminating manual stock checks and preventing costly stockouts before they happen.",
    "nodesUsed": ["Schedule Trigger", "Google Sheets (read)", "IF", "Aggregate", "IF (check empty)", "emailSend", "Discord", "Google Sheets (append)", "Error Trigger"],
    "keyLearnings": [
      "Schedule Trigger replaces the old Cron node — set interval in hours, minutes, or a specific time of day",
      "Google Sheets READ returns one item per row — n8n processes them all in a loop automatically",
      "IF node filters: TRUE output = matches condition, FALSE = does not. Connect only the TRUE output to continue",
      "Aggregate node is critical for summary workflows — collapses N items into 1 item with array fields",
      "After Aggregate, fields become arrays: $json.productName is ['Widget A', 'Widget B'] — use .map() or .join() in templates",
      "Double IF pattern: first IF filters low stock, second IF checks the array isn't empty before sending alerts",
      ".map() in n8n expressions lets you build dynamic HTML table rows or Discord fields from arrays"
    ],
    "googleSheetColumns": {
      "Inventory": ["productName", "sku", "currentStock", "reorderThreshold", "supplier", "category"],
      "Alert Log": ["alertTime", "itemsAffected", "productNames", "alertType"]
    },
    "credentialsNeeded": ["Google Sheets OAuth2", "SMTP", "Discord Webhook"]
  }
}
